<%#
  Marks every page of the staging deployment (WEAVE_ENV=staging) so it can
  never be mistaken for production: a yellow and black hazard-stripe frame
  around the viewport and a STAGING tab at the top. Both ignore pointer events
  and take no space, so they never cover a control. The CSS is in
  app/assets/tailwind/application.css.
%>

<% if Weave.staging? %>
  <div class="staging-frame" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="staging-tab" role="status">Staging</div>
<% end %>
